# reserve-temporal — a reserved kind with a temporal window projects duration + on_elapse.
# halt (deny on elapse, the safe default) and proceed (fail-open) both round-trip; the
# elapse resolution itself is the host's, not a language verdict.
actor a
gate decide risk high grant a
reserve loans by legal duration 30d : halt
reserve memos by legal duration 7d : proceed
cord a -> decide
cord decide -> master
